= The KPD Banned

On 23 November, General Hans von Seeckt, who holds executive power under the state of emergency, bans the KPD across Germany. The Rote Fahne is suppressed and party offices are closed. The ban will last until the end of February 1924.

On 15 November the new Rentenmark began to replace the worthless paper mark. Prices are starting to hold. The revolutionary year is ending.
